6ca/ss_017a290a7e9383045c186826118b56304dc896ca.600x338.jpg?t=1754269682"}],"short_description":"In this AVG game, players control freshman Lula Ruan, navigating dorm life and campus dynamics. Through choices, personality traits, and relationship management, they shape Lula's growth, unlock story paths, and influence endings with the \u201cbutterfly effect.","steam_appid":3920770,"support_info":{"email":"lvluo@66rpg.com","url":"http://www.66rpg.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Russian, Indonesian, Thai, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}